{
  "dom_id": "step-534138",
  "name": "Equations Containing Additional Linear Terms",
  "problem": "When we want to solve a square root radical equation which has the square root on the left-hand side and a linear function on the right-hand side, like\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2x-1}=x,\n$$\n\nwe raise both sides to the power of $2.$ This allows us to get rid of the radical, and gives us a quadratic equation that is easier to solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\sqrt{2x-1})}^{2} & ={(x)}^{2} \\\\ 2x-1 & ={x}^{2} \\\\ {x}^{2}-2x+1 & =0 \\\\ (x-1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ x & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRemember that in square root equations, we should always check the obtained value(s) to ensure that they are actually solutions of the original equation.\n\nHere, we check that the obtained value $x=1$ is actually a solution of the original equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2(1)-1} & \\overset{?}{=}(1) \\\\ \\sqrt{1} & \\overset{?}{=1} \\\\ 1 & =1\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $\\sqrt{2x-1}=x$ has the solution $x=1.$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-534138\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"534138\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"14245\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-534138\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-12\">Equations Containing Additional Linear Terms</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"534138\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                        